            <note corresp="#d229-f2" n="39" xml:id="d229-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it reported miscellaneous information obtained from SHAEF regarding
                    the signing of the act of military surrender at Berlin, May 8
                    (740.00119–EW/5–945).</p>
            </note>
